    "section_target": "### Playback API Resolution",
    "delta_type": "new_section",
    "content": "### Playback API Resolution\n- **Direct API Usage**: `show_api_descriptions` output is often truncated. Do NOT rely on scanning it to find playback APIs. If you need to play music, try `apis.spotify.play_music(access_token=..., playlist_id=...)` directly.\n- **Fallback Logic**: If `play_music` fails with 422, check for `play_playlist` or `play_song`. If all fail, check `add_to_queue` followed by verifying if playback starts automatically.\n- **Avoid Infinite Loops**: Do not spend excessive turns iterating through pages of playlists or searching for the API name. Once a suitable playlist is identified, attempt to play it immediately.",
